  "body": "Implementation follow-up from the design decision on #5699 (adopted 2026-11-05, task 10135 triage).\n\n## Scope\nIn `fleet-config`: role-socket path helpers for queue-broker and secrets-broker, mirroring `broker_socket()` precedence (env > config > default; `crates/fleet-config/src/lib.rs:265-290`): `$XDG_RUNTIME_DIR/fleet/<role>.sock` when XDG_RUNTIME_DIR is set, else `Config::state_dir()/run/<role>.sock`. Plus `[<role>] transport = \"socket\" | \"tcp\"` preference parsing in the `search_via` style (a preference between working routes, not a disable lever), preserving deny-unknown-fields discipline.\n\nThe proxy's historical `.cache/laptop-agent/broker.sock` path is a compatibility contract and stays as-is; only role sockets are new.\n\n## Acceptance\n- Helpers + parsing covered by tests (oracle: the existing broker_socket()/search_via() resolution behavior).\n- Decision on #5699 linked from the fleet-config docs/comments touched.\n",
